  "source_pdf": "downloads/big-cards-little-numbers-v2-zh-Hans.pdf",
  "source_sha256": "8a8c1af8e5006c784196c0f3cc8c39a6089942c7acbfa03566979ecd639bfca3",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "54c0ddc224e3fdbab38bb251fa326aa5f7c8c8ef36c756e644f4c18f126651d3",
      "text": "大纸牌，小数字",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "1d62f3e8f0eb0350b3350dc21ee2d7c1de6c333d2349307b9c48df3146dfbaf9",
      "text": "哪吒在画数字卡。\n大卡片上写着3，\n小卡片上写着5。\n2",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "cdbdbbcb879adcd1e6f74085bd5a79678220bb5c4df7bdc22205fd014e760920",
      "text": "哪吒说：“我们来玩个游戏，\n看谁的数字大，谁就赢！”\n3",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "3235f08c15e0b15331a0a45e7f08004134baf55cb4c706afa3b1f8765c157727",
      "text": "悟空一把抓起大卡片：\n“卡片这么大，数字一定大！\n我赢啦！”\n4",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "dfeef3f0fdf41a608dfff54d0da450923ec3aabb5f9d64486e21805ea0193951",
      "text": "玉兔跳过来问：\n“3比5大吗？\n我们问问珠子吧！”\n5",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "0a76853d7f833606cfdbe147ae005dbc0ac197d5f70e93acab86d5cb837b4c97",
      "text": "这些珠子都一样大。\n“卡片上的数字是几，\n就在旁边放几颗珠子。”\n6",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "c0f5ca3c1fce38243ec31db43aca457fb9eeb852efa1ab6ff54ab57ec2f5dbf3",
      "text": "悟空在3的旁边放珠子：\n“一、二、三。”\n三颗珠子。\n7",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "931e4bd65da1b4c6117549ac9d77400b35743ab87a1132563cd7ddf52b8c13aa",
      "text": "哪吒在5的旁边放珠子：\n“一、二、三、四、五。”\n五颗珠子。\n8",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "885a46cbc81d6fd6f505b348a8814f37369c7f5ae38975cabc4668125a7f21e8",
      "text": "玉兔指着说：“看！\n五颗珠子比三颗多，\n所以5比3大。”\n9",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "3dd0dab917752f0fa65906b6af2af635f0bb4bdcdefc56f5d541b4392f3810ca",
      "text": "“可是我的卡片那么大呀！”\n哪吒咯咯笑：\n“卡片大，数字小。”\n10",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "f1adbaea534ab1b1b87a4c2a14db5e3fc16a932de1551e2445f741c93e9f8b94",
      "text": "哪吒想到一个好主意。\n他又画了两张新卡片：\n小小的3，大大的5！\n11",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "0f9a9e9bb0b1ab0388f701dbb5ae97e2dd059c00ae2aa3bdcfd7fa2fd2cb6d47",
      "text": "他们又摆起珠子：\n3放三颗，\n5放五颗。\n“和刚才一样！”\n12",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "cb8c05ad9e6ab57284746b6b85e4459b07052b0fcb565d51e8597f74ee1474ef",
      "text": "悟空哈哈笑：\n“卡片大也好，小也好，\n数字告诉我们有几个！”\n13",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "0db5b2f4ab305a7c6f3c88b5965d7224218e0f6372007322bc1ed88e43def44b",
      "text": "接着，悟空也画了一张卡片，\n比哪张都大，\n上面写着1！\n14",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "990341cb451ffa4ba26489bfb59a66851d0a9428a8d8eb3e771ae0b6b21e112b",
      "text": "“数字1，放一颗珠子。”\n悟空放下一颗珠子：\n“一颗珠子住这么大的房子！”\n15",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "29e86a15a2e144b01e5b9ecf2daeb312f9996f4a4a958e719f3f3ecc04aac013",
      "text": "他们做好1到5的卡片，\n有大有小，\n每张旁边都放好珠子。\n“我们再玩一次吧！”\n16",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d5fe2412537ab0ab9a468f8fb7e11a30b221231ff6b956d3c19f2625a27017f1",
